{"3012260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ZukuRace", "steam_appid": 3012260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ZukuRace is a classic racing game with realistic physics and futuristic cars.<br>You can take part in racing event somewhere on the Earth in optimistic future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 3 cars, 3 tracks, career mode to unlock them all. PvE, PvP, split screen and multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Modes: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Race: Select a track, a car and drive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career: Unlock new cars and tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer: Just run with your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split screen local PvP (Select player 2 in &quot;Quick Race&quot; mode).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a complex car physics including tire, wheel, suspension dynamics, aerodynamics: (front, rear wings and body contributions).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ZukuRace is a gamepad-oriented racing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It requires precise trigger presses (e.g. trail braking technique) and analog stick movement. It was developed and tested with XBox gamepad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play with keyboard as well (not the best experience).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steering wheel is not supported yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If any bugs are encountered, please report them on the Discord server. No personal data is collected, so if something goes wrong, a report would be appreciated. Help me to make an awesome game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is constantly evolving — new features will be added as soon as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopefully, you find this game interesting. Welcome here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ZukuRace is a classic racing game with realistic physics and futuristic cars.<br>You can take part in racing event somewhere on the Earth in optimistic future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 3 cars, 3 tracks, career mode to unlock them all. PvE, PvP, split screen and multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Modes: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Race: Select a track, a car and drive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career: Unlock new cars and tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer: Just run with your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split screen local PvP (Select player 2 in &quot;Quick Race&quot; mode).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a complex car physics including tire, wheel, suspension dynamics, aerodynamics: (front, rear wings and body contributions).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ZukuRace is a gamepad-oriented racing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It requires precise trigger presses (e.g. trail braking technique) and analog stick movement. It was developed and tested with XBox gamepad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play with keyboard as well (not the best experience).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steering wheel is not supported yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If any bugs are encountered, please report them on the Discord server. No personal data is collected, so if something goes wrong, a report would be appreciated. Help me to make an awesome game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is constantly evolving — new features will be added as soon as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopefully, you find this game interesting. Welcome here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "ZukuRace is a futuristic racing game with sim physics. You take part in racing event somewhere on the Earth in optimistic future.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012260/8fac110c699468e9c824dd28309d43e990c53057/header.jpg?t=1756324652", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012260/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756324652", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012260/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756324652", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Zukurace team"], 